  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "15",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "15",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu enu ana kwetu, nukuyileja nsaŋu yayiwahi yinayishimwinini, yimwatambwili, mumwemena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoyi nsaŋu yayihandishaŋa, neyi mukukakelamu; neyi nehi, kwiji mwetiyili chamukunkulwayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa násambilili kuyileja nsaŋu yanlejeluwu ami, yeliluwu nawu, Kristu wafwili kukoola nyiloŋa yetu, mwomwaya nyikanda yajila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, amujiikili, amusaŋwili mudi afu hefuku damu chisatu, mwomwaya nyikanda yajila; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, wamwekeni kudi Petulu, kulondelamu nikudi ikumi nayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indi neyi Kristu amushimunaŋa nawu amusaŋula dehi mudi afu, enu amakwawu mwahoshelaŋadi nenu afu hiyakuyisaŋulaku? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi neyi afu hiyakuyisaŋulaku, komana niKristu hiyamusaŋulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi Kristu hiyamusaŋulaku, komana kushimuna kwetu kunekali dehi kwamukunkulwayi, nikukuhwelela kwenu kunekali kwamukunkulwayi nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi afu hiyakuyisaŋulaku, komana niKristu hiyamusaŋwiluku, ninetu, twashimunaŋa netu Nzambi wamusaŋwili Kristu mudi afu, tunekali dehi ayinsahu akutwambila Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi afu hiyakuyisaŋulaku, komana niKristu nawa hiyamusaŋulaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi Kristu hiyamusaŋulaku, kukuhwelela kwenu kunekali kwamukunkulwayi, muchidi munshidi yenu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niantu anakami dehi tulu mudi Kristu ananoŋi dehi kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi tunakuhweleli Kristu muwumi wunu hohu bweŋi, komana yetu tunabadiki antu ejima wushona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Kristu amusaŋula dehi mudi afu, nekali dehi nyikabu yatachi yawenawa anakami tulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chaleteluwu kufwa kudi muntu, kudi muntu nawa diku kwenjili kusaŋuka kwawafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chafwaŋawu antu ejima mudi Adama, dichi nawa antu ejima akayihandishila mudi Kristu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiŋa muntu nachendu chindi, muntu nachendu chindi; Kristu diyi nyikabu yatachi, nkumininaku niantu ambala aKristu hakenzayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu dihu hakenza kukumisha, hakahanayi Kristu wanta kudi Nzambi, yowu Tata; hamba kela nanoŋeshi dehi kuyula kwejima, niwanta wejima, niŋovu jejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiŋa akayula yule-e, nichamba kadatayi ayilumbu jindi ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chilumbu chakukuminina akanoŋeshayi, yowu kufwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi nehi, indi awa apapatishilaŋawu afu analondidi? Neyi afu hiyakayisaŋulaku, ayipapatishilaŋadi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iku kufwa kutwakeŋa aŋa kumona hefuku hefuku, tukukumwenadi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ana kwetu, nukuyileja chakola, nanochu chinadisambilaŋa hansaŋu yenu mudi Kristu Yesu Mwanta wetu, nami nafwaŋa hefuku hefuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinalwili kuEfwesesa neyi chalwaŋawu antu nawanyama ayisumi, chikunheteshadi neyi afu hiyakuyisaŋulaku? Komana tukumini dakudya nakunwa, muloŋa kumadiki tukufwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi ayidimbaku; kudikunda nawantu atama kwatamishaŋa maana amawahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tonenu mwikali aloŋa, mubuli kuvulumuna; muloŋa kudi antu amu hiyamwiluka Nzambuku. Chinahoshi ichi nalondi kuyitiyisha nsonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wumu wukwihula nindi, Afu akuyisaŋula ŋahi? akenza namujimba wudi ŋahi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi wabula maana, oyu yiwukutumba, chiŋa yisambili kufwa kulonda yihandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninoyu mbutu yiwukutumba, hiwukutumba chuma chamba kekalaku, chiŋa inawu dadeni, hela datidiku hela dambutu yacheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Nzambi hakuyimenesha mwakeŋa elayi yomweni, mbutu namwayu, mbutu namwayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyijimba yejima hinyijimba yoyimuku; kudi yawantu, kudi nyijimba yacheŋi yawanyama, kudi nyijimba yacheŋi nawa yawatujila, niyacheŋi yawanshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi yuma yamwiwulu, niyuma yahanu hamaseki. Kudi kuwaha kwachuma chamwiwulu, kudi kuwaha kwacheŋi kwachuma chahanu hamaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi kuwaha kwetaŋwa, kudi kuwaha kwacheŋi kwakakweji, nikuwaha kwacheŋi kwatutumbwa; muloŋa nitutumbwa twaambuka, aka nakuwaha kwaku, aka nakuwaha kwaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dimu mwakasaŋulawu niafu. Akutumbawu nakutoka akamusaŋula nákubula kutoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akutumbawu nakusawuka akamusaŋula nakulema. Akutumbawu nákubula Ŋovu akamusaŋula naŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujimba waheseki wakutumbawu, akawusaŋula himujimba waspiritu. Kwekala mujimba waheseki, kwekala nawa mujimba waspiritu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi anasoneki nawa nawu, Adama watachi welili muntu wawumi; Adama wakukuminina welili spiritu wahandishaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waheseki diyi wasambilaŋa, bayi waspirituku, himukulondela waspiritu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu watachi wahamaseki hilunkuŋu; muntu wamuchiyedi wamwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chineli muntu wahamaseki hilunkuŋu, chochaduwu ninawa ahamaseki nawa; chekalayi wamwiwulu, dichi chaduwu ninawa amwiwulu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chitunekali mwekalayi muntu wahamaseki, dimu mutwakekalila nawa neyi chekalayi muntu wamwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu enu ana kwetu, nukuhosha nami mujimba waheseki hiwukutwesha kuswana wanta waNzambi uku; hela kutoka hikukuswana kubula kutokaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu niyileji nsaŋu yajindawu. Wejima wetu hitwakakama tuluku, ilaŋa akatu balumuna wejima wetu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hohenohu, mukulabula kwadisu, hampùŋa yakukuminina. Muloŋa mpùŋa yakavuma, niafu akayisaŋula nákubula kutoka, ninetu akatu balumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ichi chatokaŋa chiŋa chakavwala kubula kutoka, niniwu wafwaŋa chiŋa akavwala kubula kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi chatokaŋa chichakavwala kubula kutoka, niniwu wafwaŋa chakavyalayi kubula kufwa, henohu dihu dinu hakalumbuluka ichi chanasonekuwu nawu, Mushindu wunaminyi kufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi kufwa, mushindu weyi wowudihi? Eyi kufwa, kusumana kweyi kwokudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imuna yakufwa yoyi nshidi; Ŋovu yanshidi nshimbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 15:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tusakililenu Nzambi watwimikilaŋa mushindu mudi Mwanta wetu Yesu Kristu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.15.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.15.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
